export const html = "<h1>Video Clip / Snapshot</h1>\n      <hr class=\"rule\" />\n\n<p>Video clips and snapshots can be attached to AI app actions such as Email, HTTP, FTP, and AWS. These video clips and snapshots are typically 3&ndash;5 seconds long.</p>\n\n<div class=\"figure\" style=\"border-left:3px solid var(--border);background:#fafbfc;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;\"><strong>Note:</strong> video clips and snapshots use the <code>.TS</code> file format. In most cases you'll need to install VLC Player to view them.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>Follow the steps below to add video clips and snapshots to an action. In this example, we'll navigate to <strong>Active AI Apps &rsaquo; Intrusion Detection</strong> and click <strong>Add</strong>.</p>\n\n<div class=\"figure\">\n<div class=\"app-window\">\n  <div class=\"app-topnav\">\n    <div class=\"app-logo\">&#9679; Indo AI <span style=\"font-weight:400;opacity:.7;\">AI Bridge</span></div>\n    <div>&#9776; &nbsp; Device 9656E1</div>\n    <div class=\"app-right\">Arm/Disarm <span style=\"background:#2653d6;border-radius:10px;width:34px;height:18px;display:inline-block;position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;right:2px;top:2px;width:14px;height:14px;background:#fff;border-radius:50%;\"></span></span> Arm &nbsp; <span class=\"btn small\">&#9633; Video Preview</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"app-body\">\n    <div class=\"app-sidebar-nav\">\n      <div class=\"grp\">Video</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">Video Input</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">Event Rule List</div>\n      <div class=\"grp\">System Settings</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">Network</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">System</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">License Management</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">AI Cloud</div>\n      <div class=\"grp\">App Settings</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">AI App Store</div>\n      <div class=\"item active\">Active AI Apps</div>\n      <div class=\"item\" style=\"padding-left:26px;\">Intrusion Detection</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">LPR-Vehicle</div>\n      <div class=\"item\">System Event Settings</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"app-main\">\n      <div class=\"app-breadcrumb\">Home / Application / Intrusion Detection / 1</div>\n      <div class=\"app-h\">Edit Rule</div>\n      <div class=\"app-panel\">\n        <div class=\"form-grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns:130px 1fr;font-size:12.5px;\">\n          <span>Rule Name</span><input value=\"Rule #9095\" disabled>\n          <span>&#9432; UUID</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-muted);\">65be1e24-ad17-4c98-9e4e-5a7bb13c8906 &#128465;</span>\n          <span>&#9432; Enable</span><span style=\"background:#2653d6;border-radius:10px;width:34px;height:18px;display:inline-block;position:relative;\"><span style=\"position:absolute;right:2px;top:2px;width:14px;height:14px;background:#fff;border-radius:50%;\"></span></span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\">\n          <strong style=\"font-size:12.5px;\">Event Settings</strong><span class=\"btn small primary\">+ Add</span>\n        </div>\n        <table class=\"app-table\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">\n          <tr><th>Event Type</th><th>Video</th><th>Event Name</th><th>UUID</th><th>Actions</th></tr>\n          <tr><td>Intrusion Detection</td><td>CH 2</td><td>Intrusion Detection</td><td>&#128465;</td><td>&#9998; &#128465;</td></tr>\n        </table>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:14px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\">\n          <strong style=\"font-size:12.5px;\">Action Settings</strong><span class=\"btn small primary\" style=\"outline:2px solid #d64545;\">+ Add</span>\n        </div>\n        <table class=\"app-table\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">\n          <tr><th>Action Type</th><th>Action Name</th><th>Actions</th></tr>\n          <tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;color:var(--text-muted);\">&ndash;</td></tr>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<figcaption>Intrusion Detection &rarr; Edit Rule &rarr; Action Settings &rarr; Add</figcaption>\n</div>\n\n<p>From the <strong>Action Type</strong> dropdown list, select <strong>Email(SMTP)</strong>.</p>\n<div class=\"figure\" style=\"max-width:340px;\">\n<div class=\"app-panel\">\n  <div class=\"form-grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns:80px 1fr;\">\n    <span>Action Type</span><select disabled><option>Email(SMTP)</option></select>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>Click <strong>Add Email(SMTP) Action</strong>.</p>\n<div class=\"figure\" style=\"max-width:520px;\">\n<div class=\"app-panel\">\n  <span class=\"btn small primary\" style=\"outline:2px solid #d64545;\">+ Add Email(SMTP) Action</span>\n  <table class=\"app-table\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">\n    <tr><th>Name</th><th>Actions</th></tr>\n    <tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;color:var(--text-muted);\">&ndash;</td></tr>\n  </table>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<p>Add a previously configured SMTP email, then scroll down and enter an optional email message, and check the <strong>Attach Snapshot</strong> and <strong>Attach Video Clip</strong> options.</p>\n\n<div class=\"figure\" style=\"max-width:460px;\">\n<div class=\"app-panel\">\n  <div class=\"form-grid\" style=\"grid-template-columns:150px 1fr;font-size:12.5px;\">\n    <span>SMTP Server</span><select disabled><option>My SMTP Server</option></select>\n    <span>To</span><input placeholder=\"recipient@example.com\" disabled>\n    <span>Subject</span><input value=\"{{EVENT NAME}} at {{TIMESTAMP}}\" disabled>\n    <span>Message</span><span></span>\n  </div>\n  <textarea disabled style=\"width:100%;min-height:60px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:8px;font-size:12.5px;margin-top:4px;\"></textarea>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:12px;font-size:12.5px;\">\n    <label style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled> Attach Snapshot</label>\n    <label style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled> Attach Video Clip</label>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<figcaption>Email(SMTP) action &ndash; enable Attach Snapshot and Attach Video Clip</figcaption>\n</div>\n\n<p>Then click the <strong>Test</strong> button to test the email settings. Once the settings are complete, click <strong>Apply</strong> to close the window.</p>\n<p>Click <strong>Apply</strong> again in the next window.</p>\n<p>Finally, click <strong>Save</strong> to save your changes.</p>\n\n<p>Now, whenever an event occurs, you'll receive the snapshot and video clip at the email address you configured.</p>";
